{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createIndexedDB(options): Promise<IndexedDBInstance>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db.ts:281"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates or opens an IndexedDB database with the specified stores.\nCall this once at app startup, then pass the instance to collections.\nThe connection closes on versionchange so another context can upgrade or\ndelete the database. Affected Collections enter error and retain their rows.\nRecreate affected Collections with a new instance before\nfurther persistence."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All stores are created in a single upgrade transaction, avoiding\nversion race conditions when multiple collections share a database."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CreateIndexedDBOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateIndexedDBOptions"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/IndexedDBInstance.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IndexedDBInstance"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const db = await createIndexedDB({\n  name: 'myApp',\n  version: 1,\n  stores: ['todos', 'users', 'settings'],\n})\n\nconst todosCollection = createCollection(\n  indexedDBCollectionOptions({\n    db,\n    name: 'todos',\n    getKey: (item: { id: string }) => item.id,\n  })\n)","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createIndexedDB(options): Promise<IndexedDBInstance>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db.ts:281\n\nCreates or opens an IndexedDB database with the specified stores.\nCall this once at app startup, then pass the instance to collections.\nThe connection closes on versionchange so another context can upgrade or\ndelete the database. Affected Collections enter error and retain their rows.\nRecreate affected Collections with a new instance before\nfurther persistence.\n\nAll stores are created in a single upgrade transaction, avoiding\nversion race conditions when multiple collections share a database.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`CreateIndexedDBOptions`](../interfaces/CreateIndexedDBOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`IndexedDBInstance`](../interfaces/IndexedDBInstance.md)\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await createIndexedDB({\n  name: 'myApp',\n  version: 1,\n  stores: ['todos', 'users', 'settings'],\n})\n\nconst todosCollection = createCollection(\n  indexedDBCollectionOptions({\n    db,\n    name: 'todos',\n    getKey: (item: { id: string }) => item.id,\n  })\n)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createIndexedDB\ntitle: createIndexedDB\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createIndexedDB(options): Promise<IndexedDBInstance>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db.ts:281\n\nCreates or opens an IndexedDB database with the specified stores.\nCall this once at app startup, then pass the instance to collections.\nThe connection closes on versionchange so another context can upgrade or\ndelete the database. Affected Collections enter error and retain their rows.\nRecreate affected Collections with a new instance before\nfurther persistence.\n\nAll stores are created in a single upgrade transaction, avoiding\nversion race conditions when multiple collections share a database.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`CreateIndexedDBOptions`](../interfaces/CreateIndexedDBOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`IndexedDBInstance`](../interfaces/IndexedDBInstance.md)\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await createIndexedDB({\n  name: 'myApp',\n  version: 1,\n  stores: ['todos', 'users', 'settings'],\n})\n\nconst todosCollection = createCollection(\n  indexedDBCollectionOptions({\n    db,\n    name: 'todos',\n    getKey: (item: { id: string }) => item.id,\n  })\n)\n```\n"}
